      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.16,
          "end": 6.3,
          "en": "Narrator: So we split our app into at least two modules,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 6.3,
          "end": 10.83,
          "en": "or if you count the routing modules into four modules,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 10.83,
          "end": 12.18,
          "en": "before we split it even more,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 12.18,
          "end": 14.34,
          "en": "and we also learn about different types",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 14.34,
          "end": 16.023,
          "en": "of modules we could add.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 16.95,
          "end": 18.9,
          "en": "Let me dive into one important note",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 18.9,
          "end": 21.54,
          "en": "about components we load via routing.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 21.54,
          "end": 24.03,
          "en": "Like here, the recipes component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 24.03,
          "end": 26.01,
          "en": "The recipes component is loaded whenever",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 26.01,
          "end": 28.5,
          "en": "we wizard slash recipes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 28.5,
          "end": 31.65,
          "en": "The recipes component is also declared here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 31.65,
          "end": 33.72,
          "en": "in the recipes module.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 33.72,
          "end": 37.86,
          "en": "Let me remove that declaration and that export here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 37.86,
          "end": 41.13,
          "en": "and let's see if the app still works thereafter.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 41.13,
          "end": 42.3,
          "en": "It doesn't.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 42.3,
          "end": 44.85,
          "en": "Now we get that the component recipes component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 44.85,
          "end": 47.43,
          "en": "is not part of any engine module,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 47.43,
          "end": 49.95,
          "en": "so it's really important to understand",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 49.95,
          "end": 52.5,
          "en": "that you don't just add to declarations",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 52.5,
          "end": 54.21,
          "en": "what you plan on using in a template,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 54.21,
          "end": 56.64,
          "en": "but you also have to add any routes here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 56.64,
          "end": 58.26,
          "en": "that you load via routing.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 58.26,
          "end": 59.88,
          "en": "So via routing conflict.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 59.88,
          "end": 62.25,
          "en": "It's not enough to just point at it here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 62.25,
          "end": 65.313,
          "en": "You really just also need to have it here in declarations.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 66.21,
          "end": 68.67,
          "en": "The other important thing I wanted to highlight is",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 68.67,
          "end": 71.589,
          "en": "that now that we manage the loading",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 71.589,
          "end": 75.3,
          "en": "of our components here with recipes routing,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 75.3,
          "end": 77.52,
          "en": "we do define which component should be loaded",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 77.52,
          "end": 78.87,
          "en": "for which route.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 78.87,
          "end": 81.63,
          "en": "There is no reason to still export",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 81.63,
          "end": 83.25,
          "en": "all these recipe components",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 83.25,
          "end": 85.8,
          "en": "because we're now only using them internally",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 85.8,
          "end": 87.39,
          "en": "in the recipes module.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 87.39,
          "end": 91.2,
          "en": "We're using them either embedded into other components here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 91.2,
          "end": 94.17,
          "en": "or by loading them through the recipes routing module.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 94.17,
          "end": 96.42,
          "en": "Both is part of this file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 96.42,
          "end": 98.1,
          "en": "So there is no reason to export",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 98.1,
          "end": 99.81,
          "en": "the recipe components anymore",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 99.81,
          "end": 102.18,
          "en": "because we're not using these recipe components",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 102.18,
          "end": 104.64,
          "en": "in the app component or any child component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 104.64,
          "end": 105.69,
          "en": "of the app component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 105.69,
          "end": 107.19,
          "en": "And therefor, as you can see,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 107.19,
          "end": 109.38,
          "en": "if we reload and rebuild everything,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 109.38,
          "end": 111.699,
          "en": "this app still works as before",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 111.699,
          "end": 115.773,
          "en": "even if I don't export all the recipe components anymore.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
